data: {"id": "d3974619aeca43c6-final", "run_id": "d3974619aeca43c6", "seq": 1270, "ts_ms": 1788811845205, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l` | NotReady | Pod workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l 处于 NotReady 状态，Readiness Probe 失败 (HTTP 503)。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | K8s Event | `Readiness probe failed: HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 503` (fact-49a392fd9616) | 证明探针检测失败的确切原因，Kubelet 收到了 503 响应。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | K8s State | `Ready` 状态为 `False`，原因 `ContainersNotReady`；`ContainersReady` 为 `False`；容器重启计数 `0` (fact-15518c02cbbb, fact-e163e04a2f76, fact-aeaf1e67812e) | 确认 Pod 处于 NotReady 状态且未发生重启，排除了因重启导致的临时不可用。 |\n| 3 | Logging | Logging | 日志聚合呈现持续报错模式：`dependency unavailable`，`http_status: 503`，路径 `/work` (fact-24c56af49a20, 聚合 15 次) | 提供应用侧日志事实，证明应用业务逻辑正在主动向探针或服务端返回 503。 |\n| 4 | Tracing | Tracing | Deepflow 聚合 L7 Flow 显示从 `172.16.104.55` 发往 Pod IP `172.16.104.35` 的 `GET /work` 请求持续返回 `503` (fact-180c1ddb06b3, 聚合 9 次)；Tempo Span 确认状态码 503 (fact-35d44011bae4) | 证实请求链路完整到达 Pod 并在应用层被拒绝，进一步确认是应用内部返回 503。 |\n| 5 | Metric | Metric | 应用容器 CPU 总使用量为 `9.630196` seconds，仅 1 个样本 (fact-adb85a9e62ee) | 排除因 CPU 节流或资源耗尽导致应用无响应；CPU 使用量极低，与资源压力无关。 |\n\n**证据关系说明：**\n*   **现象与事实一致**：K8s Event (证据 #1) 直接记录了 503 错误，这与 Logging (证据 #3) 和 Tracing (证据 #4) 中应用返回 503 的事实完全吻合。\n*   **排除资源瓶颈**：Metric (证据 #5) 显示 CPU 消耗极低，配合零重启计数 (证据 #2)，排除了 CPU 飙升或 OOM 导致应用假死的可能。\n*   **结论指向**：应用进程正常运行并处理请求，但其内部业务逻辑主动返回了 503 错误。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用容器内的业务依赖不可用 → 应用逻辑主动返回 HTTP 503 (dependency unavailable) → Kubelet Readiness Probe 获取 503 状态码 → Pod Ready 条件不满足，状态转为 NotReady\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：\n应用容器 `app` 中的业务逻辑因**依赖服务不可用（dependency unavailable）**，持续向 `/work` 和探针接口返回 `HTTP 503` 错误。由于 Readiness Probe 依赖于该接口返回 `200 OK` 才能判定 Pod 健康，导致探针持续失败，Pod 最终被 K8s 调度器标记为 `NotReady`。\n\n**支撑事实引用**：\n*   应用日志明确抛出 `dependency unavailable` (证据 #3)；\n*   Tracing 和 K8s Event 一致确认了 503 响应 (证据 #1, #4)；\n*   非资源类问题 (证据 #5, #2)。\n\n**未知/需进一步调查项**：\n上游依赖的具体是哪个服务实例或组件不可用（现有日志未包含更深层的依赖报错细节，无法确认具体是哪个上游下游链路故障）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 3.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 198.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l: 198.1s (Evidence 189.0s, RCA 9.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 230.085, "metrics": {"run_id": "d3974619aeca43c6", "mttr": {"value": "3.8m", "seconds": 230.08984351158142, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 230089.84351158142, "llm_calls": 17, "llm_duration_ms": 142109.71188545227, "tool_calls": 45, "executed_tool_calls": 22, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 23, "successful_tool_calls": 44, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 205179.7969341278, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 72663.69152069092}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17860.14413833618, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 198144.96088027954, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 14061.298847198486, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

